## Verification Plan

### Automated Verification
- Run `dotnet build` on C# backend to ensure 0 compilation errors.
- Run `npx ng build` on Angular frontend to ensure 0 compilation errors.

### Manual Verification
- Log in on mobile device, accept notification prompt.
- Perform a doctor action (e.g., complete appointment or propose reschedule) from Doctor portal.
- Close the mobile PWA app tab and verify native phone lockscreen alert appears with HealSync branding and link.
